<div class="space-y-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto py-4 font-sans animate-fade-in">
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-6 border-b border-base-200">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-normal text-base-content tracking-tight">Estadísticas</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/50">Monitorea tus tasas de apertura, precisión de predicciones y shifts emocionales en el tiempo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shrink-0">
      <a href="<%= dashboard_path %>" class="btn btn-outline border-base-200 text-base-content/85 hover:bg-base-200/50 rounded-2xl px-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider cursor-pointer min-h-[44px]">
        &larr; Volver a mis cartas
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Tasa de apertura</h3>
        <span class="text-base text-primary">👁️</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-base-content"><%= @open_rate %>%</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">abiertas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full bg-base-200 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-success h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: <%= @open_rate %>%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed">
        El porcentaje de cartas entregadas que has abierto y leído hasta hoy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Tasa de click</h3>
        <span class="text-base text-primary">🔗</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-base-content"><%= @click_rate %>%</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">accedidas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full bg-base-200 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-primary h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: <%= @click_rate %>%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed">
        Proporción de enlaces de acceso único que han sido activados desde tus notificaciones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-base-200 pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Tasa de rebote</h3>
        <span class="text-base text-primary">⚠️</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
        <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-base-content"><%= @bounce_rate %>%</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">rebotadas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full bg-base-200 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="bg-error h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: <%= @bounce_rate %>%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed">
        El porcentaje de correos que no pudieron entregarse correctamente a tu buzón.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xs">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Cápsulas creadas</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-base-content mt-1"><%= @total_letters %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xs">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Entregadas</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-success mt-1"><%= @delivered_letters %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xs">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">En tránsito</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-warning mt-1"><%= @scheduled_letters %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-5 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xs">
      <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-base-content/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Lecturas totales</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-base-content mt-1"><%= @total_opens %></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 border-b border-base-200 pb-3.5">
        <span class="text-xl">🧠</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-base-content">Tu evolución emocional</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed">
        El promedio de cambio en tus estados internos comparando el día que sellaste tus cartas con el día que las abriste.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 pt-2">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-base-content/85 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Índice de Felicidad</span>
            <span class="text-base-content/50 font-mono">
              <%= @avg_initial_happiness %> &rarr; <%= @avg_reveal_happiness %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-base-200 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-primary/20 absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full" style="width: <%= @avg_initial_happiness * 10 %>%"></div>
            <div class="bg-primary absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full opacity-80" style="width: <%= @avg_reveal_happiness * 10 %>%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[9px] font-bold text-base-content/30 uppercase">
            <span>Tu pasado</span>
            <span>Tu presente</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-base-content/85 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Índice de Ansiedad</span>
            <span class="text-base-content/50 font-mono">
              <%= @avg_initial_anxiety %> &rarr; <%= @avg_reveal_anxiety %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-base-200 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-primary/20 absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full" style="width: <%= @avg_initial_anxiety * 10 %>%"></div>
            <div class="bg-primary absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full opacity-80" style="width: <%= @avg_reveal_anxiety * 10 %>%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[9px] font-bold text-base-content/30 uppercase">
            <span>Tu pasado</span>
            <span>Tu presente</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-base-content/85 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider">Índice de Motivación</span>
            <span class="text-base-content/50 font-mono">
              <%= @avg_initial_motivation %> &rarr; <%= @avg_reveal_motivation %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-base-200 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div class="bg-primary/20 absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full" style="width: <%= @avg_initial_motivation * 10 %>%"></div>
            <div class="bg-primary absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full opacity-80" style="width: <%= @avg_reveal_motivation * 10 %>%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[9px] font-bold text-base-content/30 uppercase">
            <span>Tu pasado</span>
            <span>Tu presente</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-base-100 border border-base-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-2xs space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 border-b border-base-200 pb-3.5">
        <span class="text-xl">🔮</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-normal text-base-content">Precisión de predicciones</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed">
        El porcentaje de aciertos en tus predicciones del futuro (sobre las cartas que ya han sido abiertas y reveladas).
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-4 space-y-5">
        <div class="radial-progress text-primary font-sans text-3xl font-extrabold shadow-2xs"
             style="--value:<%= @prediction_match_rate %>; --size:8.5rem; --thickness: 10px;"
             role="progressbar"
             aria-valuenow="<%= @prediction_match_rate %>"
             aria-valuemin="0"
             aria-valuemax="100"
             aria-label="Tasa de acierto en predicciones: <%= @prediction_match_rate %>%">
          <%= @prediction_match_rate %>%
        </div>

        <div class="text-center space-y-1">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Porcentaje de aciertos</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50 leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
            Has acertado en <strong><%= @matched_predictions %></strong> de tus <strong><%= @completed_predictions %></strong> predicciones completadas. Actualmente posees <strong><%= @total_predictions - @completed_predictions %></strong> predicciones adicionales selladas en tránsito hacia el futuro.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
